; Paintbrush as a link server and the other servers of Windows 3.1
; (Packager, Sound Recorder) as embedding servers, through OLECLI
doc OS2PB
linkfile PBrush C:\WINDOWS\ARCADE.BMP
query
update
activate 0
wait 3000
update
close
reconnect
update
close
delete
embfile PBrush C:\WINDOWS\ARCADE.BMP
query
close
savestream
delete
create Package
wait 3000
close
delete
create SoundRec
wait 3000
close
delete
revokedoc
wait 3000
waitgone PBRUSH
waitgone PACKAGER
waitgone SOUNDREC
